# Editing backups of the manifest, not pack content.
#
# Each of these is a near-complete copy of modpack.json taken by hand before
# some risky edit. There were 21 of them at ~1.6 MB each -- 35 MB of almost
# identical JSON, which is a third of this folder and would sit in the history
# permanently. The manifest's real history is the commits.
#
# They are only ignored, never deleted: they stay on disk for as long as they
# are useful. Delete one for real when you no longer want it.
modpack.json.bak*
modpack.json.bak
modpack - Copy.json

# The pack the editor exports from this folder. Rebuildable, and large.
*.smspack
